# Octets that are not one whole RDM message. `error <kind> at <offset>`.

# Nothing.
 => error truncated need 26 at 0

# A DMX null start code packet.
00 01 02 03 => error not-rdm at 0

# Start code 0xcc with the wrong sub-start code.
cc 02 18 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 00 01 00 00 00 20 00 60 00 04 06 => error not-rdm at 0

# The header cut short.
cc 01 18 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 00 01 00 00 00 => error truncated need 26 at 20

# A length that disagrees with the data length.
cc 01 19 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 00 01 00 00 00 20 00 60 00 04 07 => error length 25 not 24 at 2

# A checksum one off.
cc 01 18 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 00 01 00 00 00 20 00 60 00 04 07 => error checksum 0x0407 not 0x0406 at 24

# The checksum's second octet missing.
cc 01 18 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 00 01 00 00 00 20 00 60 00 04 => error truncated need 26 at 25

# An octet after the checksum.
cc 01 18 4c 55 12 34 56 78 7a 70 00 00 00 01 00 01 00 00 00 20 00 60 00 04 06 00 => error trailing at 26
